&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Familiarity with ML tooling such as MLflow, ZenML, or Metaflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with AWS services (e.g., EC2, EKS, CloudFormation, Cognito)&lt;/li&gt;
