&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Social Account Director to lead the activation and delivery of social workstreams for a major European fashion brand. This role will ensure that strategic thinking is translated into brilliant, well-managed social outputs across content, influencer,&amp;nbsp;creator&amp;nbsp;and community-led activity. You will be the operational heartbeat of the account, keeping work moving, teams aligned and delivery at a consistently high standard.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
