&lt;p&gt;When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button below, this will send any information you add below to Burson. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy. &lt;/a&gt;California residents should read our  &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice. &lt;/a&gt;This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson, part of WPP, is the global communications leader built to create value for clients through reputation. With highly specialized teams, industry-leading technologies and breakthrough creative, we help brands and businesses redefine reputation as a competitive advantage so they can lead today and into the future. When you work at Burson, you are part of a global community of lifelong learners who thrive at the edge of innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP (LSE/NYSE: WPP) is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;WPP.com&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/&quot;&gt;bursonglobal.com&lt;/a&gt; and follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/burson/posts/?feedView=all&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/burson.global/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More about the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW91818119 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW91818119 BCX8&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW91818119 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW91818119 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW91818119 BCX8&quot;&gt;Senior Account Director&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW91818119 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW91818119 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW91818119 BCX8&quot;&gt;with strong knowledge of the B2B technology space&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW91818119 BCX8&quot;&gt;to join our Technology practice on a&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight SCXW91818119 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentStart CommentHighlightPipeRest CommentHighlightRest SCXW91818119 BCX8&quot;&gt;12-month maternity cover contract&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW91818119 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun CommentHighlightPipeRest SCXW91818119 BCX8&quot;&gt;. In this role, you will take on a strategic lead and trusted consultative role across a flagship portfolio of global enterprise accounts including&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW91818119 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW91818119 BCX8&quot;&gt;Qualcomm, Cellnex, Wipro, Adobe, and Park Place Technologies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW91818119 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW91818119 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;You will drive high-impact B2B communication strategies, manage&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW91818119 BCX8&quot;&gt;revenue&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW91818119 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and account profitability, and lead daily team execution under the guidance of senior practice leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW91818119 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This role offers the opportunity to develop under the guidance of some of the best in the industry and gain first-hand experience working on high-profile international brands.&amp;nbsp;The experience of the&amp;nbsp;team&amp;nbsp;enables us to deliver&amp;nbsp;integrated communications, from corporate, B2B and consumer communications, to digital &amp;amp; social, influencers, analyst relations, content&amp;nbsp;marketing&amp;nbsp;and public affairs. We understand technology ecosystems, consumer and business audiences, and the power of the influencer.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Having a passion for enterprise tech, telecommunications, and digital infrastructure is essential for this role as you will be leading accounts for some of the world’s most influential B2B technology leaders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Whether navigating telecoms infrastructure, wireless innovation, data&amp;nbsp;center&amp;nbsp;services, or global IT consulting, as we progress into a new era defined by advancements in AI, cloud, and connectivity, it’s crucial we continue to turn complex B2B technology stories into compelling, human-first narratives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
