&lt;p&gt;You will connect customer-facing experiences, shared technical foundations, and operational capabilities to make DataDome easier to adopt, administer, integrate, operate, and scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer experience and adoption&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
